        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu nende omukhasi omuSamaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa Omwami yamanya shinga abaFarisayo olwa bali nibahuliile mbu Yesu akholanga abandu abanii okhuba abeechi okhushila Yohana, nababatisia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa Yesu omwene shiyali nabatisinjia ta, habula abeechibe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yarula ebuYahudi, niyeenyokha nakalukha eGalilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yali nakhoyile okhubirila muSamaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yoola khwitaala lindi lieSamaria elilangwa mbu Sikari, ahambi nomukunda okwo okwa Yakobo yaheelesia Yusufu omwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne isebele yaYakobo yali ebweneyo. Kho Yesu, olwa yali nachoonyile khulwa oluchendo, yeekhala butswa ario hasebele. Yali shinga isaa yakhasasaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukhasi undi omuSamaria niyeetsa okhutaha amatsi; Yesu namusaba ari Umbekhwo amatsi enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba abeechibe bali nibatsiile mwitaala okhukula ebiokhulia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omukhasi omuSamaria namureeba ari Kali karie, iwe omuYahudi okhusaba isie amatsi, olwa endi omukhasi omuSamaria? Okhuba abaYahudi shibanyweelelananga amatsi nende abaSamaria ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nakalusia namusunjila ari Niwakhamanyile eshihaanwa shiaNyasaye, nende oukhusaba mbu Umbekhwo amatsi enywe, shinga olwa ali, khane nawe wakhamusabile ye, naye yakhakhuheele amatsi amalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi oyo namusunjila ari Omwami, kata eshiokhutayila obula ninashio, khandi liyabo lili hasi muno; kho orusia heena amatsi ako amalamu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe oshila kuuka weefwe Yakobo, owakhuheelesia liyabo lino, omwene nanywamwo, nende abaanabe, nende emirukochie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nakalusia, namusunjila mbu Buli mundu ounywakhwo khumatsi kano, obuloho bulamulia khandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne omundu yesi oulanywa khumatsi aka ndalamuheelesia, obuloho shibulamulia khandi ta; ne amatsi ako aka emuheelesia kalaba muye isebele yamatsi akafututukha okhuula khubulamu bwobumeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi oyo namusunjila ari Omwami, umbekhwo amatsi ako, obuloho mana buleshenje okhundia, kata isie okhwitsanga hano okhutaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namubiila ari Tsia olanje omusaatsawo, mana witse hano ninaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi nakalusia, namusunjila mbu Shindi nende omusaatsa ta. Yesu namusunjila ari Otechile noboola mbu Shindi nende omusaatsa ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba wateeshibwa nabasaatsa baraano; ne owa oli ninaye bulaano shiali ye omusaatsawo tawe; ako oboolile habwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omukhasi namusunjila mbu Omwami, ndakhalola mbu oli omunabii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuuka beefwe beenamilanga Nyasaye mushikulu shino; neenyu muboola mbu muYerusalemu nimwo omwa abandu bakhoyile okhumwinamila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namuboolela mbu Mama, suubila khulianje lino, mbu eshise shiitsanga eshia muraleenamilanga Papa kata mushikulu shino, kata muYerusalemu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe mwinamilanga eshia muramanyile ta; ifwe khwinamilanga eshia khumanyile; okhuba obuhonia burula mubaYahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa eshise shiitsanga, kata bulaano shiulile, olwa abamwinamila toto balamwinamila Papa muroho nende obwatoto; okhuba abafwana bario nibo aba Papn akhaabanga mbu bamwinamilenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye niye Roho; nabo abamwinamila bakhoyile okhumwinamilanga muroho nende obwatoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi namusunjila ari Emanyile mbu Masihi ali okhwitsa, oulangwa mbu Kristo; naye olwa alaba niyeetsile, alakhufwimbulila amakhuwa kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namuboolela mbu Isie ouboolana ninawe, ISIE NISIE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwenaho abeechibe nibeetsa; nibahuka shichila yasungana nende omukhasi; nebutswa yabulaho owareeba mbu Wenya shiina? Kata mbu Osungananga ninaye mbushiina? Tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omukhasi yalekha isiongoye natsia mwitaala, naboolela abandu ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitse mulole omundu oumbooleele kosi aka ndakhola; uno shiyakhaba nali ye Kristo watsana ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibarula mwitaala, nibachaaka okhutsia ewa yali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne inyumawe abeechibe nibamusaaya, bari Rabi, yitsa olie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabasunjila ari Endi nende ebiokhulia ebia muramanyilekhwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeechi nibasungana, bari Oundi akhamuleereele eshiokhulia noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nababoolela mbu Ebiliibwa bianje nibio okhukhola aka owaruma yeenya, nende okhumalilisia emilimochie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe shimuboolanga mbu chishili emiesi chine, mana lichesa liitsa, ta? Lole, isie emusunjila mbu chinguule tsimoni tsieenywe, muhenje emikunda, mbu chimalile okhulaba nichituushila lichesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouchesa alia omushaara, nakhung'aasia ebiamo okhuula khubulamu bwobumeli; mbu mana ouraaka nende ouchesa beekhoyele halala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila mukeenako olusungo luba olwatoto, mbu Mulala araaka, oundi achesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamurumile okhuchesa ebienebio ebia muranyakhanila ta; abandi nibo abanyakhana, neenyu mwayeenjiile mubunyakhani bwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaSamaria abanji abomwitaala elo nibamusuubilila khulwa likhuwa liomukhasi oyo, owarumbula mbu Yambooleele kosi aka ndakhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa abaSamaria bamwitsila, bamusaaya mbu amenye ninabo; naye nakonayo khabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi abanji nibamusuubilila khulwa amasungoke; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibamusunjila omukhasi oyo bari Bulaano khusuubiile, ne shikhuli khulwa okhusunga khukhwo ta; okhuba if we abeene khuhuliile nikhumanya mbu toto mwene uno niye Omuhonia weshialo shiosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yahonia omwana womukhulundu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma lwetsindaalo etsio tsibili yarulayo natsia eGalilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba Yesu omwene yarumbula mbu omunabii shialikhwo noluyali mushialo shiabwe omwene ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa yoola eGalilaya, abaGalilaya nibamwinjisia, shichila bali nibaluutsi ako kosi aka yakhola eYerusalemu khwisabo elo; okhuba bosi bali nibatsiile khwisabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho niyoola khandi eKana muGalilaya, ewa yakalukhasia amatsi okhuba idivai. Ne yali naliho omukhulundu nalebe weitookho, owa omwanawe yalwalila eKaperinaumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa yahulila mbu Yesu urulile ebuYahudi, winjiile muGalilaya, yatsia ewa yali namusaaya mbu akholomosheyo, ahonie omwanawe; shichila yali nali okhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yesu namusunjila mbu Nimuraluutsi ebilolelo nende ebiamakana shimulasuubila nahatuutu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhulundu oyo namusunjila mbu Omwami, kholomokhayo omwana wanje olwa ashili okhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namusunjila mbu Tsia butsia; omwanawo nomulamu. Omusaatsa oyo nasuubila likhuwa elia Yesu yamusunjila, natsia butsia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali nakholomokhanga abasumbabe nibamwakaanila, nibasunga mbu omwanawe nomulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yabareeba mbu neisaa shiina olwa yachaachile okhuhona? Nabo nibamukalusia mbu Eshiabeele, khusaa yomusaafu, omurengo kwamuleshile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho samwana namanya mbu neisaa yatsana olwa Yesu yamusunjila mbu Omwanawo nomulamu; ye omwene nasuubila, halala nende abomunzuye bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho shino neshilolelo shiakhabili eshia Yesu yakhola narulile ebuYahudi niyeenjiile muGalilaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
